    "name": "Surfpunk",
    "steam_appid": 2434830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/509c21ef247f561e69577be4b5ddda89.poster.avif?t=1752089543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/509c21ef247f561e69577be4b5ddda89.webm?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/509c21ef247f561e69577be4b5ddda89.mp4?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER ONLINE CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up with friends or go solo as you scavenge sunken ruins across a massive, monster-infested archipelago. Work together to succeed against overwhelming odds, grab as much loot as you can, and escape in style by surfing a massive tsunami wave to become the most legendary surfer-pirates of the sea!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURF, SHRED, SCAVENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your high-speed \u201cRushboard\u201d to hop between islands, tow your loot barge, and chain movement with combat to stay ahead of the chaos. Every mission is a fast-paced mix of exploration, action, and extraction\u2014with no two runs playing out the same.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/e14b91dce2961109684737d99a0b98b1.poster.avif?t=1752089543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/e14b91dce2961109684737d99a0b98b1.webm?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/e14b91dce2961109684737d99a0b98b1.mp4?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 UNIQUE WEAPON CLASSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from four distinct weapon classes, each with their own flashy moves and strategic roles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice &amp; dice with the <strong>Sword</strong> \u2013 A balanced melee class that heals through aggression and thrives up close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through enemies with <strong>Dual Pistols</strong> \u2013 Rapid-fire damage, explosive tricks, and the ability to jump up cliffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash the swarm with <strong>Anchor &amp; Chain</strong> \u2013 Wield raw power to slam, yank, and obliterate enemies with crushing force.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shred support riffs with the <strong>Guitar</strong> \u2013 Disrupt enemies and buff allies using electrified chords and pulsing soundwaves.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT ON THE GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest resources mid-run to craft gadgets like ladders, explosives, and makeshift boards. Break through barriers, improvise escape routes, or set traps for enemies. Quick thinking and creativity turn the tide of every quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE OR WIPEOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you extract more loot, enemies become stronger as time runs out. When the islands start shaking and the water rises, you\u2019ll have to make your escape before a colossal tsunami swallows everything. Navigate obstacles and surf your way back to safety, with your barge full, if you\u2019re lucky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/7fb7c704fb17efbe42f827a0d44ef835.poster.avif?t=1752089543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/7fb7c704fb17efbe42f827a0d44ef835.webm?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/7fb7c704fb17efbe42f827a0d44ef835.mp4?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HANG OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return your plunder to the Beastship \u2013 your floating home on the seas. Share your loot with the onboard crew to craft new weapons, enhance your gear, customize your looks, and unlock new abilities. The Beastship also offers a place to pick up some side quests for unique loot or just hang out in between quests as you discover the world of <i>Surfpunk</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/58f4899da079382858ba545385117d2b.poster.avif?t=1752089543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/58f4899da079382858ba545385117d2b.webm?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/58f4899da079382858ba545385117d2b.mp4?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVER-CHANGING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dozens of procedurally generated islands in each quest, teeming with enemies to battle, secrets to discover and loot to scavenge. Each journey sends you into a dynamic world teeming with unique events and challenges. No two sessions are the same!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/509c21ef247f561e69577be4b5ddda89.poster.avif?t=1752089543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/509c21ef247f561e69577be4b5ddda89.webm?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/509c21ef247f561e69577be4b5ddda89.mp4?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 PLAYER ONLINE CO-OP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up with friends or go solo as you scavenge sunken ruins across a massive, monster-infested archipelago. Work together to succeed against overwhelming odds, grab as much loot as you can, and escape in style by surfing a massive tsunami wave to become the most legendary surfer-pirates of the sea!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURF, SHRED, SCAVENGE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your high-speed \u201cRushboard\u201d to hop between islands, tow your loot barge, and chain movement with combat to stay ahead of the chaos. Every mission is a fast-paced mix of exploration, action, and extraction\u2014with no two runs playing out the same.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/e14b91dce2961109684737d99a0b98b1.poster.avif?t=1752089543\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/e14b91dce2961109684737d99a0b98b1.webm?t=1752089543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2434830/extras/e14b91dce2961109684737d99a0b98b1.mp4?t=1752089543\"